I think this is coherent.

****   lo broda = lo dahi broda = da poi dahi broda            ****
****   da poi broda = da poi dahinai broda = lo dahinai broda  ****

Since you wrote this and before I received it, I posted a summary of
options on {lo}. This was number [3], & I feel it best represents
current usage. I hope (vainly, I expect) that the upshot of my
summary will be that the issue is settled (in the sense that everyone
agrees - maybe on the above equation).

